    "title": "Female Firefighter Weekend Returns for Its Second Year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Teaney ,\n6 hours ago Fayette County, WV (WOAY) – Are you a female firefighter? Or are you a gal out there who thinks they might like to see what it takes to be a firefighter?. Well, this Saturday, the Wilderness Instruction and Leadership Development Training Institute, easily referred to as the Wild Institute, has a class for all the ladies who have or may have an interest in firefighting. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
